abstract: >-
  C2Cognitive (Convert to Cognitive Engineering) is a repository-governed
  persistent-cognition and bounded-authority system for long-running AI coding
  agents. It separates durable cognition from repository-write authority and
  governs how evidence may be admitted, remembered, reused, promoted into
  Skills, represented as source-bound structural state, projected into a
  derived Wiki, exposed through bounded Agent Loadouts, and carried across
  handoff or resume boundaries. C2Cognitive v1.0.0 includes typed L0-L3 Memory,
  provenance and freshness controls, exact write and rollback authority,
  Bounded Read v2, Adaptive Context Representation Planning, cognitive and
  repository emergency controls, progress-liveness self-audit, workflow and
  mobile governance, and a bundled C2ModelAdapter v0.5.5 host/runtime boundary.
  Persistence, model output, cache state, routing state, and worker output do
  not automatically become evidence or repository mutation authority.

